                <tr><td>trades</td><td class="n">58</td><td class="n">8</td><td class="n bad">0</td></tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>
          <p>
            Plus 194 hardcoded <code>px</code> values in the retail CSS. The amount is
            <code>fontSize: 88</code> at ten call sites. <code>$99999.99</code> measures
            <span class="num">430&nbsp;px</span> — it clips on the largest phone made. On a 320&nbsp;px
            phone the wrap pushes the hero to <code>y: -162</code> and the split-bill pill to
